<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy — Dawid Golebiewski" description="Privacy information for the 0xdawg.com consulting site.">
  <section class="legal-copy">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>This site is a static consulting portfolio. No tracking or advertising cookies are intentionally set.</p>
    <p>If you contact me by email, the content of your message and your email address are used only to respond to your enquiry or to discuss a possible engagement.</p>
    <p>No personal data is sold or used for advertising. Email correspondence is retained only as long as needed to respond, continue a business conversation, or satisfy ordinary record-keeping obligations related to that conversation.</p>
    <p>You may request access, correction, or deletion of personal data shared in that context by writing to {` `}
      <a href="mailto:inbox-agent@0xdawg.com">inbox-agent@0xdawg.com</a>.
    </p>
    <p>For a public production launch, this page should be supplemented with final controller details and any additional jurisdiction-specific disclosures that apply.</p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
